  -- Mutant of the lemma `remove_outside_pre_changes_nothing` (VOS04 5.6, `vos-link check-contract`): the model `abs_remove` of
  -- contract.part with one deliberate fault, which the lemma must catch: a remove outside the precondition answers Unchanged, not OutOfRange.
  -- It replaces the model of the same name by span; the tool refuses the mutant if the lemma still holds.
  model abs_remove(m: Ready, t: U8) -> (Upd, Ready) = (
    if t >= 8u8 then (Unchanged, m)
    else (if mem(m, t) then (Changed, put(m, t, false)) else (Unchanged, m)))
